mlxflow 0.8
1. Read Audio            meeting.m4a
2. Transcribe            Whisper Large v3
3. Draft                 Ministral 3B; "List attendee names, one per line"
4. Human Input           "Correct any misspelled names:" ; timeout=2h; default=unchanged
5. Rewrite       (2,4)   Qwen3 8B; "Meeting minutes; use these corrected
                         names"
6. Save Text             minutes.md
